Description: SylkServer WebRTC gateway client library and tools
 A client of SylkServer's webrtcgateway (the sylkRTC protocol): domain
 discovery, video rooms, 1 to 1 calls and the account's addressbook, with
 GStreamer webrtcbin for the media. No SIP stack is needed.
 .
 Tools: sylk-conference joins a video room with audio and chat and publishes
 local or RTSP (LAN) cameras in it; sylk-session makes and takes 1 to 1 calls;
 sylk-addressbook shows and changes the account's contacts and groups, shared
 with Sylk Mobile and Blink; sylk-account shows the account's private storage
 (avatars, key escrow, devices); sylk-journal summarises its message journal;
 sylk-settings manages their configuration.
